  "scientific_restrictions": {
    "claim": "Prospective applicability of exact finite observed-learning criteria on pinned benchmark cases only. There is no present learning, convergence, qualification or scientific pass from this review.",
    "allocation": "All original indices0..4 complete their unchanged finite allocation in original order and remain retained. Supervised canonical base+index and native42..46 stay fixed; original index0 is predetermined for serving. Missing, incomplete, duplicate, reordered, substituted, wrong-budget or nonfinite children fail. Finite failures remain. No seed replacement, pooling episodes as models, cherry-picking, selected retries, hidden attempts or budget/deadline extensions.",
    "joint_and_served": "At least3 SAME original models each jointly satisfy strict own-effective-initial gain and every applicable reference predicate. Successes on different coordinates/models cannot be pooled. All-five statistics include every finite failure/below-floor member and pass every unchanged family quality bar. Served original index0 independently satisfies its own joint learning/reference, quality, budget, selected device, completion, exact full graph/search/head replay, Store and authenticated qualification/journal chain. Its own metric is not the cohort median.",
    "classification": "Exact finalCorrect>initialCorrect and finalCorrect>=max(actual held-out largest class count+1, exact Binomial(n,1/C) upper-tail critical count at alpha1/5000). At n1000 the chance counts are136,24,16 for10,100,200 classes. Actual majority can strengthen them. All-five median and served0 historical floors additionally apply.",
    "regression": "On the same retained finite binary64 targets/predictions, exact rational SSE_final<SSE_initial and SSE_final<SST, positive target variance and finite positive scale. The unchanged standardized-RMSE ceiling additionally applies at all-five median and independently served0; rounding/tolerance cannot create a strict improvement.",
    "probability": "Only under prospective allocation and the stated all-five independent-uniform-per-example null: each event probability<=1/5000; E[N]<=5/5000 implies P[N>=3]<=1/3000 with no between-seed independence; at most30 fixed classification cohorts have union bound<=0.01. Uniform marginals alone are insufficient. This calculation is conditional, not automatic acquisition confidence. No mixed-null, arbitrary random-network, adaptive/repeated-attempt, regression, native-RL or population guarantee.",
    "held_out_adaptivity": "Initial/final comparisons require the same pinned inputs, descriptors/transforms and authentic before-update snapshots. Held-out data are not automatically fresh after outcome-guided development. Reused outcomes and all attempts remain retained. Freezing this review does not erase selection/adaptivity bias or establish population generalization.",
    "historical_bars": "Every original target/slack floor, ceiling and exclusion remains an exact additional restriction with its true provenance. Field names/positive slack do not turn project policy into a published-model anchor. Tiny binary64(0.64-0.632)=0.008000000000000007 was chosen after measured0.012 and retains that history. Other unproved/higher floors may still reject learning. No failed bar is waived, relabelled or rebaselined.",
    "return": "The same20 canonical starts/horizon, complete prescribed reference controllers once in order and exact paired median arithmetic remain mandatory. Final strictly improves its authentic effective initial and beats EVERY reference. A reference tie is allowed only for supported KeyDoor when both actual reference and final equal the current complete-state/time legal-transition DP maximum; supplied/historical bounds, epsilons, above-bound observations and other RETURN ties fail.",
